221
00:08:42,560 --> 00:08:46,560
sample fast enough, we can go back and

222
00:08:44,560 --> 00:08:49,120
forth between continuous and discrete

223
00:08:46,560 --> 00:08:51,440
forms without losing information. You

224
00:08:49,120 --> 00:08:53,120
can repeat this process over and over

225
00:08:51,440 --> 00:08:55,440
with different sample sets, and it will

226
00:08:53,120 --> 00:08:57,600
work every time.

227
00:08:55,440 --> 00:09:01,959
In short, with the right sampling rate,

228
00:08:57,600 --> 00:09:01,959
