229
00:09:03,519 --> 00:09:07,839
Now, here's a bad case when the sampling

230
00:09:05,680 --> 00:09:10,000
rate is too low.

231
00:09:07,839 --> 00:09:12,240
The black curve is again our original

232
00:09:10,000 --> 00:09:14,480
continuous signal. The blue points are

233
00:09:12,240 --> 00:09:16,160
