256
00:10:01,120 --> 00:10:05,279
the sampling theorem is essential. If

257
00:10:03,200 --> 00:10:08,519
you don't sample fast enough, the damage

258
00:10:05,279 --> 00:10:08,519
is permanent.

259
00:10:10,000 --> 00:10:15,760
