816
00:32:33,840 --> 00:32:38,720
that frequency in the signal. That's our

817
00:32:36,080 --> 00:32:40,640
forier coefficient.

818
00:32:38,720 --> 00:32:43,840
We can also see this as a matrix

819
00:32:40,640 --> 00:32:46,720
multiplication. The time samples f of 0,

820
00:32:43,840 --> 00:32:48,399
f of 1, f of n minus one form a column

821
00:32:46,720 --> 00:32:51,039
