826
00:32:58,880 --> 00:33:03,120
The result is another vector containing

827
00:33:00,880 --> 00:33:08,159
all the frequency samples fhat of zero

828
00:33:03,120 --> 00:33:10,399
fhat of one fhat of n minus one.

