using the inverse FFT to get back to the

1355
00:54:13,280 --> 00:54:18,000
time domain.

1356
00:54:16,160 --> 00:54:19,920
So if you want to reinforce what we've

1357
00:54:18,000 --> 00:54:24,920
just covered or see it implemented step

